// Primitive literal scalar decoding and normalization parity.

---NAME---
surrogate scalar escape is rejected
---SOURCE---
"\uD800"
---EXPECT-ERROR---
Invalid Unicode scalar escape: \uD800

---NAME---
uppercase surrogate scalar escape is rejected
---SOURCE---
"\XDFFF"
---EXPECT-ERROR---
Invalid Unicode scalar escape: \XDFFF

---NAME---
out of range scalar escape is rejected
---SOURCE---
"\U00110000"
---EXPECT-ERROR---
Invalid Unicode scalar escape: \U00110000

---NAME---
raw strings normalize to NFC
---SOURCE---
"""é"""
---EXPECTED---
"é"
---ROUNDTRIP---

---NAME---
interpolated text normalizes to NFC
---SOURCE---
$"é {value}"
---EXPECTED---
$"é {value}"
---ROUNDTRIP---
